#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:30
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:47
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:69
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:84
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Starfighter"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:10
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:31
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Interceptor"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:15
msgid ""
"The Exuari fighter 'Dagger' is a single-seated spacecraft, very quick and "
"agile, that does not do a lot of damage, but usually comes in larger groups. "
"They are able to dodge most missiles and attack undefended areas of their "
"enemies ships. However most of the Exuari fighter pilots expect their own "
"death and do not care much about the enemies weapons ranges. Fighters are "
"easy to take out, but should not be underestimated."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:27
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Blade"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:36
msgid ""
"The Exuari interceptor 'Blade' is a improved fighter, originaly designed to "
"hunt down rougue fighters. Nowadays Blades are often seen as the first "
"attack wave of a larger assault, closely followed by Daggers. Blade pilots "
"are often considered as fearless, but most of them are just consumed by "
"their instinct for hunting."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:46
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Gunner"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:47
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:69
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:85
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Bomber"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:52
msgid ""
"The Exuari light bomber 'Gunner' is a single-seated spacecraft, designed to "
"circumvent their enemies defense lines and bring its deadly load to slow "
"moving targets. Gunners are not as agile as other fighters, but still faster "
"than most capitol ships. A group of Gunners can do a lot of damage to a "
"single stationary target if not destroyed before their target is inside "
"their weapons range. Piloting a Gunner is considered to be a recreational "
"(and often lethal) activity within the Exuari society, so don't expect "
"experienced pilots."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:67
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Shooter"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:72
msgid ""
"The Exuari bomber 'Shooter' carries two rounds of HVLIs. To keep the vessel "
"at low costs, it has no automatic missile recharge system, so the single "
"pilot has to load the second round manually. Shooter pilots tend to stay on "
"the battlefield, even without ammunition and enjoy death spreading. Due to "
"it's long reload cycle a Shooter may easily be destroyed between its attack "
"runs."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:81
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Jagger"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/starfighters.lua:89
msgid ""
"The Exuari heavy bomber 'Jagger' carries just a single round of improved "
"HVLIs. Those are considered to be hull-penetrating and cause multiple times "
"the damage of Gunner HVLIs."
msgstr ""
